# Breeze Skill Routing

When the user asks about Breeze capabilities or wants to perform a Breeze task, route to the correct skill:

| User wants to... | Skill |
|---|---|
| First-time setup, init, API key | `/breeze:setup-project` |
| Upload/onboard a source repo | `/breeze:onboard-repository` |
| Search features, code, "how does X work" | `/breeze:search` |
| Analyze a requirement, check coverage | `/breeze:analyze-functional` |
| Check architecture impact | `/breeze:analyze-architecture` |
| Analyze a Figma design | `/breeze:analyze-design` |
| Generate functional graph from frontend | `/breeze:generate-functional-from-ui` |
| Generate functional graph from backend | `/breeze:generate-functional-from-backend` |
| Detect personas from UI code | `/breeze:detect-personas` |
| Add/update nodes in functional graph | `/breeze:update-functional-graph` |
| Validate graph quality | `/breeze:validate-functional-graph` |
| Generate code from graph | `/breeze:generate-code` |
| Export functional spec document | `/breeze:generate-spec` |
| Convert designs to user stories | `/breeze:visual-to-text` |
| Generate design graph from functional | `/breeze:generate-design` |

## Recommended Pipelines

**Brownfield (existing code):**
1. `/breeze:setup-project`
2. `/breeze:onboard-repository` (once per repo)
3. `/breeze:generate-functional-from-ui` (frontend)
4. `/breeze:generate-functional-from-backend` (each backend)
5. `/breeze:validate-functional-graph`
6. `/breeze:generate-spec`

**Greenfield (from designs/docs):**
1. `/breeze:setup-project`
2. `/breeze:visual-to-text` (Figma/PDF/images)
3. `/breeze:analyze-functional` (requirement documents)

**New feature:**
1. `/breeze:analyze-functional`
2. `/breeze:analyze-architecture`
3. `/breeze:update-functional-graph`
4. `/breeze:generate-code`
